<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>babe in the womb, foetus</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β.
				ἡμίονον κυέουσαν</span>, of a mare, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.266
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.222
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>new-born babe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				37.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				6.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1096
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέον β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					289
				</span></i>
			 [not in <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>]: in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				19.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1104.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, etc.; of beasts, <i>foal, whelp, cub</i>,
			etc., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phylarch.
				36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.464
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>nestling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Horap.
				2.99
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ βρέφεος</span> from
				<i>babyhood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.567
			</span></i> (Antip.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Ti.</u>
					3.15
				</span></i>
			. (Cf. Slav. <i>žrěbę</i>
			'foal'.)</div>
